From f60fd84d022cf9e09da74a35bb22b2525f4e470f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Try Omarchy Release <actions@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 2 Sep 2026 00:42:55 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Ship yay and the base-devel toolchain in the guest

Upstream Omarchy commands such as omarchy-pkg-aur-install and
omarchy-update-aur-pkgs hard-code yay, so the factory image was shipping a
desktop whose AUR entry points failed outright. Add the base-devel group to
the pinned transaction, build yay 13.0.1 from its pinned commit with the
container Go toolchain during image builds, and stage the resulting package
in the guest's immutable local repository next to the runtime and mise.
